      "content": "Thanks for that. I want to make sure my article doesn't fall into the trap of strawmanning the civil liberties side—I don't want to make them sound like they're just being difficult or \"anti-science.\"\n\nCan you go deeper into the actual legal or philosophical frameworks they use to challenge the legitimacy of the mandate itself? I'm looking for the more sophisticated arguments regarding the limits of state power and the principle of bodily autonomy.",
